OL,3,AFlight chaos caused by software defect
OL,4,Ain the 'space of a millisecond', report
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe incident prompted questions over
OL,8,Fthe resilience of Nats' systems, and
OL,9,Fsome airlines questioned the position
OL,10,Fof its chief executive Martin Rolfe.
